    "name": "Idle Aquarium",
    "steam_appid": 3176710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/752053a23dec376a7397bcf244c94054.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual fish-raising simulation game &quot;Idle Aquarium&quot; is conveniently displayed on your screen, allowing you to enjoy the joy of being a fish keeper while working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/390163fbe22bdd5d536618778798db0f.poster.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/390163fbe22bdd5d536618778798db0f.webm?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/390163fbe22bdd5d536618778798db0f.mp4?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed Your Fish:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your little fish, make friends with them, unlock new species, and even some very rare ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/57cc8fc5e09b6af7d7ee36874ece03ad.poster.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/57cc8fc5e09b6af7d7ee36874ece03ad.webm?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/57cc8fc5e09b6af7d7ee36874ece03ad.mp4?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Aquarium:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your aquarium and turn your desktop into your favorite style, with a variety of decorations to meet all your needs. Whether it's a planted tank or a South American tank, any style you want is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/e704241c0396a8ca5a239d8dd6965bd0.poster.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/e704241c0396a8ca5a239d8dd6965bd0.webm?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/e704241c0396a8ca5a239d8dd6965bd0.mp4?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking Capability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfortably placed at the bottom of the screen, you can take care of your fish while accomplishing other tasks. Or switch to &quot;Focus Mode&quot; to quietly enjoy them without much interaction.A casual fish-raising simulation game &quot;Idle Aquarium&quot; is conveniently displayed on your screen, allowing you to enjoy the fun of being a fish keeper while working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your little fish, make friends with them, unlock new species, decorate your aquarium, and turn your desktop into your favorite style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect your Steam Drops:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play, you will have a chance to drop a steam item, There is a surprise for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/bd9c85b57ffdc1e21fae3ad899c7044d.avif?t=1741755164\" width=792 height=286 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/752053a23dec376a7397bcf244c94054.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual fish-raising simulation game &quot;Idle Aquarium&quot; is conveniently displayed on your screen, allowing you to enjoy the joy of being a fish keeper while working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/390163fbe22bdd5d536618778798db0f.poster.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/390163fbe22bdd5d536618778798db0f.webm?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/390163fbe22bdd5d536618778798db0f.mp4?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed Your Fish:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your little fish, make friends with them, unlock new species, and even some very rare ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/57cc8fc5e09b6af7d7ee36874ece03ad.poster.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/57cc8fc5e09b6af7d7ee36874ece03ad.webm?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/57cc8fc5e09b6af7d7ee36874ece03ad.mp4?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Aquarium:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your aquarium and turn your desktop into your favorite style, with a variety of decorations to meet all your needs. Whether it's a planted tank or a South American tank, any style you want is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/e704241c0396a8ca5a239d8dd6965bd0.poster.avif?t=1741755164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/e704241c0396a8ca5a239d8dd6965bd0.webm?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/e704241c0396a8ca5a239d8dd6965bd0.mp4?t=1741755164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking Capability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfortably placed at the bottom of the screen, you can take care of your fish while accomplishing other tasks. Or switch to &quot;Focus Mode&quot; to quietly enjoy them without much interaction.A casual fish-raising simulation game &quot;Idle Aquarium&quot; is conveniently displayed on your screen, allowing you to enjoy the fun of being a fish keeper while working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your little fish, make friends with them, unlock new species, decorate your aquarium, and turn your desktop into your favorite style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect your Steam Drops:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play, you will have a chance to drop a steam item, There is a surprise for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176710/extras/bd9c85b57ffdc1e21fae3ad899c7044d.avif?t=1741755164\" width=792 height=286 /></span></p>",
